    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485120/extras/97d9000c4efbc0faa8b8efc939ae7e65.avif?t=1689254163\" /></span><br>One day, the two squares, who had a dream while sleeping, tried to wake up from their dreams, but couldn't wake up in the end.<br>All the two squares could do in that dream was to open the door by pressing a button appropriate for their color and climb up an unknown place.<br>Even if I climbed all of it, I didn't know if I could wake up from my dream, but I had to, so I decided to go up there.<br>Take advantage of your skills and go all the way up to the end<br><br>You control two squares that each have different abilities at the same time.<br>Red squares can push blue squares away.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485120/extras/e8f0852465f62eff35f18ba8452d4918.webp?t=1689254163\" /></span><br><br>Blue squares have more jumping power than red squares and can stop in the air.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485120/extras/a49972ca05ecabe86bd907225edb1100.webp?t=1689254163\" /></span><br><br>Press the button that matches your color to open the door and go up to the final stage.<br><br>'Dream of a Square' was inspired by the Korean song 'Dream of Square'.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485120/extras/97d9000c4efbc0faa8b8efc939ae7e65.avif?t=1689254163\" /></span><br>One day, the two squares, who had a dream while sleeping, tried to wake up from their dreams, but couldn't wake up in the end.<br>All the two squares could do in that dream was to open the door by pressing a button appropriate for their color and climb up an unknown place.<br>Even if I climbed all of it, I didn't know if I could wake up from my dream, but I had to, so I decided to go up there.<br>Take advantage of your skills and go all the way up to the end<br><br>You control two squares that each have different abilities at the same time.<br>Red squares can push blue squares away.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485120/extras/e8f0852465f62eff35f18ba8452d4918.webp?t=1689254163\" /></span><br><br>Blue squares have more jumping power than red squares and can stop in the air.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485120/extras/a49972ca05ecabe86bd907225edb1100.webp?t=1689254163\" /></span><br><br>Press the button that matches your color to open the door and go up to the final stage.<br><br>'Dream of a Square' was inspired by the Korean song 'Dream of Square'.",
